            "Shares the rig with another program (WSJT-X, logging program…) through a virtual COM port (com0com pair): SDRLink keeps the rig's real port and passes on the other program's commands. com0com installation and pair creation from the window", "Dijeli radio s drugim programom (WSJT-X, program za dnevnik…) preko virtualnog COM porta (par com0com): SDRLink zadržava stvarni port radija i prosljeđuje naredbe drugog programa. Instalacija com0com i izrada para iz prozora",
            "Virtual COM port…", "Virtualni COM port…",
            "Virtual COM port (rig sharing)", "Virtualni COM port (dijeljenje radija)",
            "SDRLink keeps the rig's COM port and opens one of the two ports of a com0com pair; your other program (WSJT-X, logging program…) opens the other port, with the same rig model, as if it were connected to the rig. Its commands are passed to the rig between SDRLink's own. Only with the \"COM port (direct CAT)\" interface.", "SDRLink zadržava COM port radija i otvara jedan od dva porta para com0com; vaš drugi program (WSJT-X, program za dnevnik…) otvara drugi port, s istim modelom radija, kao da je spojen na radio. Njegove se naredbe prosljeđuju radiju između naredbi samog SDRLinka. Samo sa sučeljem „COM port (izravni CAT)“.",
