            "Auto Reset WebSDR: the WebSDR will be restarted after {0} s without sound (3 attempts in a row at most)", "WebSDR Auto resetten: de WebSDR wordt herstart na {0} s zonder geluid (hoogstens 3 pogingen achter elkaar)",
