            "Virtual COM port…", "Wirtualny port COM…",
            "Virtual COM port (rig sharing)", "Wirtualny port COM (współdzielenie transceivera)",
            "SDRLink keeps the rig's COM port and opens one of the two ports of a com0com pair; your other program (WSJT-X, logging program…) opens the other port, with the same rig model, as if it were connected to the rig. Its commands are passed to the rig between SDRLink's own. Only with the \"COM port (direct CAT)\" interface.", "SDRLink zachowuje port COM transceivera i otwiera jeden z dwóch portów pary com0com; Twój drugi program (WSJT-X, program dziennika…) otwiera drugi port, z tym samym modelem transceivera, jakby był połączony z transceiverem. Jego polecenia są przekazywane do transceivera między poleceniami SDRLink. Tylko z interfejsem \"Port COM (bezpośrednie CAT)\".",
