            "Things to try:", "Kaj poskusiti:",
            "1. Use version 1 of OmniRig (OmniRig 1.x by VE3NEA), available from the page below.", "1. Uporabite različico 1 programa OmniRig (OmniRig 1.x avtorja VE3NEA), na voljo na spodnji strani.",
            "2. Close OmniRig and SDRLink, then start both of them again as administrator: right-click the program, then “Run as administrator”.", "2. Zaprite OmniRig in SDRLink ter ju oba znova zaženite kot skrbnik: desni klik na program, nato »Zaženi kot skrbnik«.",
            "SDRLink is currently running as administrator.", "SDRLink trenutno teče kot skrbnik.",
            "SDRLink is not currently running as administrator.", "SDRLink trenutno ne teče kot skrbnik.",
            "3. In OmniRig (Rig 1 or Rig 2, the one chosen in SDRLink), check the rig model, the COM port and the baud rate; no other program may use this COM port.", "3. V OmniRig (Rig 1 ali Rig 2, tisti, ki je izbran v SDRLink) preverite model postaje, vrata COM in hitrost; nobeden drug program ne sme uporabljati teh vrat COM.",
            "Then click the “Connecting...” button to stop, then click “Connect”.", "Nato kliknite gumb »Povezovanje...«, da ustavite, in nato »Poveži«.",
