            "spectral", "spektralna",
            "adaptive", "prilagodljiva",
            "original", "izvirna",
            "Auto notch off in digital modes", "Samodejni notch izklopljen pri digitalnih načinih dela",
            "Auto notch off in FreeDV V1 and V2", "Samodejni notch izklopljen pri FreeDV V1 in V2",
            "Notch also on the rig audio played by SDRLink (listening on the PC, diversity)", "Notch tudi na zvoku postaje, ki ga predvaja SDRLink (poslušanje na računalniku, diverziteta)",
            "Notch type:", "Vrsta notcha:",
            "Original: filters following the whistles (4 to 8)", "Izvirna: filtri, ki sledijo žvižgom (4 do 8)",
            "Adaptive (NLMS): follows drifting whistles, handles as many as there are", "Prilagodljiva (NLMS): sledi plavajočim žvižgom, obvlada jih, kolikor jih je",
            "Spectral (FFT): the cleanest, only touches steady lines", "Spektralna (FFT): najčistejša, se dotakne le stalnih črt",
            "Notch level:", "Raven notcha:",
            "1 (original setting)", "1 (izvirna nastavitev)",
            "1 (gentlest)", "1 (najnežnejši)",
            "10 (strongest)", "10 (najmočnejši)",
            "The automatic notch detects steady whistles (carriers) in the WebSDR sound and attenuates them. A click on the button turns it on or off (green button when on, colours to choose below); right-click opens this window. Three types: original (4 to 8 narrow filters following the whistles; the level increases their number and width), adaptive (a filter removing everything that repeats, even a drifting whistle; the level sets its speed, a high level can affect the voice) and spectral (each frequency clearly above its neighbours for a while is brought down to their level; the cleanest, the level sets the threshold and the strength). Each type keeps its own level, 1 to 10. It is paused, without turning the button off, during a digital mode (decoder running or DIGI mode) and during FreeDV, if the choices above are ticked: it would damage the signals to decode. The SDRLINK cable and the decoders always receive the sound without notch.", "Samodejni notch zazna stalne žvižge (nosilce) v zvoku WebSDR in jih oslabi. S klikom na gumb ga vklopite ali izklopite (zelen gumb, ko je vklopljen, barve izberete spodaj); desni klik odpre to okno. Tri vrste: izvirna (4 do 8 ozkih filtrov, ki sledijo žvižgom; raven povečuje njihovo število in širino), prilagodljiva (filter, ki odstrani vse, kar se ponavlja, tudi plavajoči žvižg; raven določa njegovo hitrost, visoka raven lahko vpliva na glas) in spektralna (vsaka frekvenca, ki je nekaj časa jasno nad sosednjimi, se zniža na njihovo raven; najčistejša, raven določa prag in moč). Vsaka vrsta ima svojo raven, od 1 do 10. Začasno se ustavi, ne da bi izklopili gumb, med digitalnim načinom (dekoder teče ali način DIGI) in med FreeDV, če so zgornje izbire obkljukane: poškodoval bi signale za dekodiranje. Kabel SDRLINK in dekoderji vedno prejmejo zvok brez notcha.",
